  "scope": "Actual PostgreSQL17.9 raw forced-RLS fixture at 1k/100k/1M additional resources with complete authored A/B ownership, exact ordinary counts, retained native protected versus excluded-assessor plans and selected native 1ms statement timeout refusal without output. Performance metadata is coordination data, not stored-value transport. Actual selected million-row aggregate runs through pg8.16.3 and Truss original protocol runtime; native timeout has zero original DataRows, failed transaction refuses further use, and explicit rollback restores the same session. Cancellation context refuses before native BEGIN. No streaming/final-publication custody, full diagnostic closure, arbitrary workload, actual graph/Delta profile or complete B16 acceptance."
